  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Na ivakaraitaki ni code, JSON Schema, kei na template ni policy vakamasini era laiseni ena MIT License, vaka ni sega ni tukuni tale. E rawa ni vakayagataki vakalidina ena nomu vasite.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Sala ni Curu Duavata ki na Dodonu",
