  "Commercial use requires contact": "Na Vakayagataki Vakabisinisi e Gadreva na Veitaratara",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "E vakarautaki ni oti na Bletchley AI Safety Summit ka liutaki o Yoshua Bengio, ena veitokoni kei ira e uasivi 100 na daunivuku mai na vitu ka rauta 30 na matanitu vata kei na UN, OECD kei na EU, na ripoti tudei oqo e vakaduavatataka na ivakadinadina vakasaienisi ni oqori ena gauna oqo me baleta na kena rawa kei na leqa ni AI e frontier — ka vakaraitaka ni na so na ivakarau era sa rawa ni kila ni era vakatovolei tiko ka veisautaka nodra itovo me vaka kina.",
  "Companion media": "Media Veitokoni",
