  "Ensure openness is machine-executable — so goodwill is not discarded as legal uncertainty.": "Vakadeitaka ni na dodola e rawa ni cakacaka taki ena masini — me kua ni biuta na yalo vinaka me vaka na sega ni macala vakalawa.",
