  "Why a single allow/deny bit cannot govern AI-era content use — and what a rights layer looks like instead.": "Na Vuna e Sega ni Rawa ni Veiliutaki na Vakayagataki ni iYaya ena Gauna ni AI ena Dua ga na Io/Sega — kei na Ka e Rairai Kina na Dua na Tikina ni Dodonu.",
  "Why undefined openness gets cleaned out of training pipelines": "Na Vuna e Vakasavasavataki Tani Kina na Dodola e Sega ni Vakadodonutaki mai na Veisala ni Training",
  "Wilks, Ladak, and Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) argue that philosophical debate over AI consciousness overlooks psychological research on animal ethics — the same cognitive and social biases that limit moral consideration for animals will likely limit it for AI too, regardless of whether AI ever becomes conscious.": "Era vakabauta o Wilks, Ladak, kei Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) ni na veivosaki vakafilosofi me baleta na vakilai ni AI e sega ni raici na vakadidike vakasama-vakailoloma me baleta na itovo vei ira na manumanu — na ivakabauta vakasama kei na sosaiti vakatawani e vakayalataka na kena raici vakaitovo na manumanu ena na vakayalataki tale ga na AI, se vakila se sega ni vakila na AI.",
